{"id": "t042-001", "text": "Coffee with Jasmine and Henrik. They finally set a date, wedding is early June in Bergen at his parents' place. Jasmine's vegetarian now, Henrik still eats anything. Remind me to ask Jasmine about the hen do sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats anything", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Jasmine about the hen do", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t042-007", "text": "Bumped into Michael at the school gates. His twins finish primary end of the month and there's a leavers' assembly on the 23rd at half 2. He's dreading it, he'll cry apparently. Wife's away so he's on his own with it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finish primary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leavers' assembly", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 23rd at half 2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Wife", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t042-009", "text": "Joy says Wei proposed on the beach in Cornwall last weekend. Ring is his grandmother's. They're thinking spring next year for the wedding, nothing booked. Joy doesn't drink so the celebration drinks were all mocktails, which she loved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "spring next year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebration drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "mocktails", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t042-013", "text": "Ava and Joe are expecting! Due early March. She's been really sick in the mornings, can barely look at coffee, which for Ava is tragic. Joe's already painting the box room. I should drop round some ginger biscuits for her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sick in the mornings", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some ginger biscuits for her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t042-022", "text": "Hannah got into her Masters at Edinburgh! Starts mid September. Must send her something nice this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Masters at Edinburgh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something nice", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t042-027", "text": "Dalia's nephew had his first day at nursery yesterday, cried the whole morning, fine by lunchtime. She's soft on him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "nephew", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day at nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole morning"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by lunchtime"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "soft on him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t042-028", "text": "The wedding fair with Laila on Saturday is off, she's not up for it. Instead we're getting brunch Sunday at 11.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not up for it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "brunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 11", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t042-031", "text": "Message from Dawit. His sister Hiwot graduates from nursing school on the 19th at 10am. Whole family's driving up the night before. Don't forget to ask him how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiwot", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from nursing school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 19th at 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t042-034", "text": "Joe wants nothing for his birthday but he did say twice that his headphones are dying.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants nothing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "headphones are dying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t042-036", "text": "Mihai's son Luca lost his first tooth tonight. Mihai FaceTimed me just to show me the gap. Tooth fairy is apparently paying a pound.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first tooth", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t042-041", "text": "Need to buy a wedding present for Caitlin and Kieran before the end of the month. They've got a list on John Lewis.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a wedding present for Caitlin and Kieran", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "list on John Lewis", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t042-043", "text": "Aneesh and Lars. Aneesh's wife is graduating with her PhD on the 7th, ceremony in the morning, lunch after. Lars is coming too, he was her supervisor years ago. Aneesh is planning a surprise dinner at that Keralan place. I should get her flowers for the day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating with her PhD", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "was her supervisor", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "years ago"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner at that Keralan place", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her flowers", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t042-044", "text": "Hannah's dog Biscuit had his op yesterday, all went fine, very sorry for himself. She's taking Friday off to stay home with him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}]}
{"id": "t042-045", "text": "Lunch with Jasmine, Helen and Dalia. Jasmine's wedding menu tasting is Saturday the 11th at 2, she's stressing about the vegan options. Helen's daughter Maya just started Year 1 and loves it. Dalia's gone off coffee completely, says it's a migraine thing. Helen wants us all over for drinks sometime over the summer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding menu tasting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 11th at 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing about the vegan options", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Maya", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Year 1", "owner": "p6", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dalia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "off coffee", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "migraine thing", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "drinks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime over the summer", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t042-052", "text": "Caught up with Lindiwe on the phone. Her mum's recovering from the hip op and Lindiwe's back and forth to Durban a lot. Her daughter Zola finishes primary in December. She's exhausted but says it's fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zola", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishes primary", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t042-054", "text": "Salma and Mihai are off to a cousin's wedding in Bucharest in early May. Mihai's doing a speech, in Romanian, and is a wreck about it. Ask him how it went when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding in Bucharest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early May", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a wreck", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him how it went", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t042-057", "text": "Uncle Ahmed's retiring end of the month after 30 years at the hospital. Big do on the Friday at 6. Remember to chip in for the leaving gift by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday at 6", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in for the leaving gift", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t042-059", "text": "Henrik doesn't drink coffee, only tea, black, no sugar. Odd for a Norwegian.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink coffee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "only tea, black, no sugar", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Norwegian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
